participant User "User"
participant Client "Web App"
participant API "API Server"
participant DB "Database"
msg User -> Client solid filled "Click Login"
msg Client -> API solid filled "POST /api/login"
msg API -> DB solid filled "Query User Record"
msg DB -> API dotted filled "Return User Data"
msg API -> Client dotted filled "200 OK (JWT Token)"
msg Client -> User dotted filled "Show Dashboard"
